11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"瑶瑶领先和瑶瑶の专线是同一家吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"是同一家。瑶瑶の专线（也写作瑶瑶的专线、YYSSR）是旧名，现已改名为瑶瑶领先，域名仍是 yyssr.org / yyssr.net，其中 yyssr.net 注册于 2022 年 10 月，中文域名瑶瑶领先.com 注册于 2023 年 11 月。改名不是换主体，面板、节点、协议都在 2025 至 2026 年做过一轮大改版。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"瑶瑶领先值得买年付吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"不值得。经逐档核对，它的包季就是月付价乘以 3、包年就是月付价乘以 12，每 GB 单价始终是 ¥0.026，没有任何折扣。包年唯一的区别是把全年流量一次性发给你。既然长周期不省钱，就没有理由把一整年的钱压给一家中转小机场，直接月付即可。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"瑶瑶领先 iOS 能用吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"目前受限。官方公告写明，因为封 ID 太频繁加上用户误登录 iCloud 引发后续问题，暂时不提供外区 Apple ID，要等风控降低后再提供。也就是说，如果你手上没有已购买的 Shadowrocket（小火箭），iOS 端基本没有现成方案；官方给的替代建议是自己注册美区 ID 下载免费的 Clash Mi。iPhone 用户购买前务必先确认这一点。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"瑶瑶领先是专线机场吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"不是。虽然旧名叫「瑶瑶の专线」，但它实际是公网隧道中转加直连节点，并非 IPLC/IEPL 专线。多家第三方评测也是同样的描述。名字里的「专线」是品牌词，不代表线路类型，想要真正的专线要看标注清楚的 IPLC 专线机场。\"}}]}"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":"：瑶瑶领先就是原来的「瑶瑶の专线」，2022 年就在的老站，改名不是换主体。它的价格是本站目前收录里最低的一档——"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"¥9.9 给 384GB，每 GB 只要 ¥0.026"}]}],["$","$1","3",{"children":["，还附送 Emby 影视库，50 个节点全部 1 ",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/beilv","className":"text-accent hover:underline","children":"倍率"}],"不虚标，面板给的是标准 Clash / Surge / Loon / 小火箭订阅，不锁客户端。但有三件事必须先知道："]}],["$","$1","4",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"包季包年零折扣"}]}],["$","$1","5",{"children":"（就是月付乘以份数，一分不省）、"}],["$","$1","6",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"官方公告的第一条就是在教用户怎么处理「节点不稳定」"}]}],["$","$1","7",{"children":"、"}],["$","$1","8",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"iOS 目前不提供外区 ID"}]}],["$","$1","9",{"children":"。结论："}],["$","$1","10",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"便宜是真的，稳不稳要你自己试，而且只该月付。"}]}]]}],"\n"]}],["$L1b",["$","h2",null,{"id":"瑶瑶领先就是原来的瑶瑶の专线","className":"mt-12 mb-4 scroll-mt-28 border-b border-rule pb-2 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight lg:scroll-mt-20","children":"瑶瑶领先就是原来的瑶瑶の专线"}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"如果你是搜旧名字找过来的，可以确认："}],["$","$1","1",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"瑶瑶の专线（瑶瑶的专线、YYSSR）已改名为瑶瑶领先"}]}],["$","$1","2",{"children":"，域名没换，面板在 2025 至 2026 年做了一轮大改版，协议和线路都换过。这不是换老板重开的马甲站，域名注册记录可以佐证："}]]}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"my-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-10 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","div","yyssr.net",{"className":"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-2.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-sm text-muted","children":"yyssr.net"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-right text-sm font-medium","children":"2022 年 10 月注册（品牌最早足迹）"}]]}],["$","div","瑶瑶领先.com",{"className":"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-2.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-sm text-muted","children":"瑶瑶领先.com"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-right text-sm font-medium","children":"2023 